	(gr_text "After updating the USB and CAN schematics \nand footprints, use file->board setup->net classes \nto set a net class for USB and for CAN differential pairs\nto have the right impedance (use chat to tell you what settings\nto use).\nFrom the USB to the STM and from the CAN inputs to the \nCAN chips, use place->place differential pair to route an\nimpedance-matched diff. pair to make sure that we don't \nget reflections or noise on those lines when we use them"
